.nh
.TH "LAGO" "1" "Sep 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-v2-payment-receipts-resend-email - Resend a payment receipt email


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago v2 payment-receipts resend-email  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Queues an email for a receipt. Requires a premium license, valid recipients and billing entity email configuration. Returns an empty success body. Authorization uses invoice write permission.
Requires the product catalog to be enabled and invoice write permission on the API key.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--bcc\fP=""
	Additional recipients.

.PP
\fB--cc\fP=""
	Additional recipients.

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for resend-email

.PP
\fB--input\fP=""
	Complete JSON request body or @file.json

.PP
\fB--to\fP=""
	Recipients. When omitted or empty, the customer email is used.


